`, `_yarn_application_id`, `_poll_k8s_driver_via_api`).\n\nThis PR:\n1. Exposes public properties on `SparkSubmitHook`:\n   - `@property def conf(self)`\n   - `@property def kubernetes_driver_pod(self)` (with getter and setter)\n   - `@property def yarn_application_id(self)`\n2. Promotes `_poll_k8s_driver_via_api()` to public `poll_k8s_driver_via_api()` (maintaining `_poll_k8s_driver_via_api()` as a backwards-compatible alias).\n3. Updates backend strategy classes in `spark_submit.py` to use these clean public properties and methods.\n4. Adds unit test coverage in `tests/unit/apache/spark/hooks/test_spark_submit.py`.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sundeep <sundeep8967@gmail.com>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/72285/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/72285/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":30602623480,"node_id":"REFE_lADOAgUK288AAAABLWtS1c8AAAAHIA75-A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/30602623480","actor":{"login":"sundeep8967","id":71071718,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMDcxNzE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71071718?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sundeep8967","html_url":"https://github.com/sundeep8967","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sundeep8967/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sundeep8967/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sundeep8967/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sundeep8967/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sundeep8967/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sundeep8967/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sundeep8967/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sundeep8967/events{/p